n  leaked by a trustworthy sauce it is said  that as tyria played by linda carter who  appeared in the end credited scene of  wonder woman 1984 will be featured again  she and the female protagonist must find  a man named aryan as his parents are  from both atlantis and themiscara and  thus he would have the gift of unifying  both realms as the story unfolds wonder  woman is then expected to team up with  aquaman to neutralize the madden aryan  in the current version of the script the  dc superhero blue beetle who will even  get his own solo movie is also believed  to play a role what are your thoughts on  the rumors surrounding wonder woman 3 do  you think the appearance of blue beatle  and aquaman would be realistic or do you  feel it is still way too early to  speculate feel free to tell us in the  comments  in the united states it has already been  out since november 10th while in other  parts of the world it will still take a  while until the movie is released we are  talking about paramount's new family  comedy clifford the big red dog which is  delighted viewers all over the world  with its sweet story or will at least  certainly do so in the near future in  fact clifford the big red dog is the  most streamed movie on paramount plus  today grossing more than 35 million us  dollars in the u.s thus far originally  based on the 1963 children's book of the  same name by norman bridwell the story  was then chosen to be adapted into an  animated series in the early 2000s on  wednesday paramount then surprisingly  announced that they are already working  on a sequel to the story of emily and  her growing duck delivered more detailed  information is not available as of yet  so it is also unclear whether the  paramount film will once again be shown  in both theaters as well as on the  company's own streaming service or  whether it will only be accessible on  paramount plus  well there you go those were our news  for this week if you want to dive deeper  into a possibl